msgctxt "HC,VoiceRuleMeetingsInfo"
msgid "Nur in Meetings: sonst hört in der Runde niemand die Lebenden. Tote reden untereinander."
msgstr "Meetings only: otherwise nobody hears the living during the round. The dead talk among themselves."

#. Key:	VoiceRuleAlwaysInfo
