#: Source/HowCouldItBeYou/Voice/HCVoiceRules.cpp(56)
msgctxt "HC,VoiceRuleAlwaysInfo"
msgid "Immer: alle hören sich überall gleich laut. Tote hören nur Tote."
msgstr "Always: everybody hears everybody, everywhere, equally loud. The dead only hear the dead."

#. Key:	VoiceRuleNearInfo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/HowCouldItBeYou/Voice/HCVoiceRules.cpp(58)
#: Source/HowCouldItBeYou/Voice/HCVoiceRules.cpp(58)
msgctxt "HC,VoiceRuleNearInfo"
msgid "Nähe + Meetings: ihr hört, wer in der Nähe ist, im Meeting alle. Tote hören nur Tote."
msgstr "Proximity + meetings: you hear who is near you, in a meeting everybody. The dead only hear the dead."

